plode due to propellant degradation occurring after long-term exposure to higher absolute humidity, temperature and temperature cycling.","consequence":"An inflator explosion may result in sharp metal fragments striking the driver or other occupants resulting in serious injury or death.","remedy":"Honda will notify owners, and dealers will replace the passenger frontal air bag inflator, free of charge. The recall began November 6, 2018.  Owners may contact Honda customer service at 1-888-234-2138.  Honda's numbers for this recall are M2J and S2K.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1355406,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V661000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":41,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CROSSTOUR"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC HYBRID"},{"year":"2012","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"CROSSTOUR"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2011","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2012","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"19V502000","received":"2019-06-27","manufacturer":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.)","component":"AIR BAGS:FRONTAL:PASSENGER SIDE:INFLATOR MODULE","summary":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.) is recalling certain 2009-2014 Acura TSX, 2011-2014 TSX Sport Wagon, 2010-2013 ZDX, 2008-2012 Honda Accord, 2010-2011 Accord Crosstour, 2006-2011 Civic and Civic Hybrid, 2008-2010 Civic GX NGV, 2012-2015 Crosstour, 2007-2011 CR-V, 2009-2013 Fit, 2014 Fit EV, 2010-2014 Insight, and 2009-2015 Pilot vehicles. \r\n\r\nThe vehicles are equipped with passenger frontal air bag inflators assembled as a recall remedy part or replacement service part, that may explode due to propellant degradation occurring after long-term exposure to high absolute humidity, temperature and temperature cycling.","consequence":"An inflator explosion may result in sharp metal fragments striking the driver or other occupants resulting in serious injury or death.","remedy":"Honda will notify owners, and dealers will replace the passenger frontal air bag inflator, free of charge.  The recall began August 12, 2019.  Owners may contact Honda customer service at 1-888-234-2138.  Honda's numbers for this recall are F5F and Q5E.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":9555,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=19V502000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":63,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2007","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2007","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2006","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2006","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC HYBRID"},{"year":"2008","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2009","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2009","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2009","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2008","make":"HONDA